{"slug":"collin-peterson","qid":"Q434458","name":"Collin Peterson","desc":"American politician","article":"Collin Peterson","born":"1944-06-29","died":null,"birthplace":"Fargo","parties":["Democratic Party","Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"MN-07","f":1991,"u":2021},{"t":"Minnesota Senate","w":"","f":1977,"u":1987}],"summary":"Collin Clark Peterson (born June 29, 1944) is an American accountant, politician, and lobbyist who served as the U.S. representative for Minnesota's 7th congressional district from 1991 to 2021. A member of the Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party (DFL), he was chairman of the House Committee on Agriculture from 2019 to 2021 having previously held the office from 2007 to 2011; he had been ranking member from 2011 to 2019 and 2005 to 2007. Peterson was the most senior U.S. representative from Minnesota and the dean of Minnesota's congressional delegation.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":144840,"s":39.85,"w":false,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":146672,"s":52.1,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":173572,"s":52.47,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":130546,"s":54.21,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":197791,"s":60.38,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":133096,"s":55.2,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":227187,"s":72.2,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":179164,"s":69.66,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":207628,"s":66.07,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":170234,"s":65.27,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"MN-07","p":"D","v":185771,"s":68.68,"w":true,"n":"Collin C Peterson"},{"y":1998